  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 17 April 2022). Our client Mary Bhatt is a 51-year-old mechanical engineer who lives at Plot 23, Dwarka, New Delhi 110004 and can be reached on 90674 20590 or mary.bhatt@example.com. The client's PAN ECWPB4337X.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Varghese Textiles Pvt Ltd. A cheque for ₹34,80,000 issued by Varghese Textiles Pvt Ltd bounced: the drawer stopped the cheque with a stop-payment instruction.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 815807527677 (IFSC UTIB0223322).\nThe matter was filed as CC/805/2022 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at New Delhi on 25 June 2022.",
